  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Partner with <a href=\"http://enterosgel.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span class=\"s1\">Enterosgel.co.uk</span></a> and earn <span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);font-size:20px;\">15% commission</span>, plus receive a<span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(226,80,65);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);\"><u><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">gift</span></u></span> to get started </strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Enterosgel is the UK’s No.1 drug-free solution for tummy bugs, diarrhoea, and stomach pain for both kids and adults. It is a trusted award-winning product that solves real everyday problems, which makes it easy to recommend and highly relevant for the right audiences.</p><p class=\"p1\">We are looking for passionate affiliates and content creators in 3 key areas:</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Parenting / Mummy Bloggers</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">A perfect fit for creators who support mums and families with helpful, trusted recommendations. Enterosgel offers gentle, drug-free digestive relief for children and adults, making it a valuable product for parents who want to be prepared for tummy bugs and stomach upsets at home or on the go. It's tasteless and for all ages! Mums will thank you for this discovery! Be the first to share the great news with your audience. </p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Travel Bloggers</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Enterosgel is a true travel essential. It is ideal for audiences looking to prevent or manage travellers’ tummy and other digestive issues while away. Great for creators sharing holiday tips, family travel advice, packing lists, and wellness must-haves. </p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Gut Health Bloggers</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">A strong match for creators focused on digestive wellness, IBS support, and sensitive stomachs. Enterosgel is a trusted first-line, drug-free option that helps people feel more confident managing everyday digestive discomfort. It's not another probiotic or supplement. It's a clinically proven drug-free treatment recommended by top UK doctors and available from Boots and even from NHS!</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);\"><strong>15% </strong>commission on sales Plus</span></p><p class=\"p1\">A<span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);\"> gift </span>from us so you can experience the product yourself</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(243,121,52);font-size:20px;\">Your Followers and Friends will Thank you, because they will get <strong>10% OFF</strong> automatically at the check-out</span>.</span></p><p class=\"p1\">A trusted, established product with strong appeal across parenting, travel, and gut health content</p><p class=\"p1\">A chance to promote something genuinely useful that your audience will appreciate</p><p class=\"p1\">We’re looking for authentic creators who want to share products that make a real difference. If your audience includes parents, travellers, or people interested in gut health, Enterosgel could be a great fit for your content.</p></div>",
